@startuml uc_03_set_up_wifi
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title F3 Set up Wi-Fi (REQ-11, REQ-12)
start
if (Boot with saved network?) then (yes)
 :Join; 4 attempts total, 5 s between failures;
 if (Address assigned?) then (yes)
  :Keep station connected;
 else (no)
  :Show error;
 endif
 :Wait for 2 s hold in Idle;
endif
:Scan/cache, then open hotspot and portal;
:Phone joins open hotspot; QR opens page;
repeat
:Select network; password only if protected;
:Queue join; browser polls;
if (Selected network address assigned?) then (no)
 :Show join error; rescan with AP open;
endif
repeat while (Join failed?) is (yes) not (no)
 :Store credentials; retry once;
 if (Saved?) then (yes)
  :Show success;
 else (no)
  :Show save error; remain connected;
 endif
 :Show result 10 s; close hotspot/server;\nKeep station connected;
stop
floating note
 Cancel/timeout: notice then cleanup; retain an established station.
 Start takes priority: stop setup safely before audio.
 Wi-Fi-only errors preserve audio. Detailed retries/recovery: wifi-flow.
 Time, secure transport and Device registration are later FHIR acceptance.
end note
@enduml
